00004":"KANGASKHAN: ..................","msg_0133_D47_00005":"This Safari Zone is great!\\rI just kept going after Pokémon!\\nThat made my JIGGLYPUFF upset though.","msg_0133_D47_00006":"JIGGLYPUFF: Puu pupuu.","msg_0133_D47_00007":"Safari, safari,\\nit is so much fun.\\rSafari, safari,\\nso interesting, huh!\\rSo many Pokémon are waiting for us!\\r...That’s a song I made up.\\nI sing it when I am in the Safari Zone.","msg_0133_D47_00008":"Airily goes the Safari Ball under the\\nblue sky. Sprinkly goes your sweat to\\fcelebrate a friendship.\\rI love the Safari Zone!\\r...I made a whole jingle out of it.\\nYou think anyone would be interested?","msg_0133_D47_00009":"I’ve decided to carry Pokémon drinks.\\rThis will be new to me, but I will do\\nmy best...\\r","msg_0133_D47_00010":"Oh, you want to buy something?\\nCan you wait while I get it ready?\\rJust a minute...\\f..................\\r","msg_0133_D47_00011":"BUTTERFREE: Flu flu.","msg_0133_D47_00012":"There are many Pokémon to choose from,\\nbut nothing beats the cuteness of\\fSLOWPOKE.\\rPeople often say that I look like one!","msg_0133_D47_00013":"SLOWPOKE: ...Yawn?","msg_0133_D47_00014":"I have always wanted to catch my first\\nPokémon at the Safari Zone.","msg_0133_D47_00015":"You may be under the impression\\nthere is a sophisticated system to\\fcustomizing the Safari Zone, right?\\rThe real truth is that...","msg_0133_D47_00016":"Arrrgh...\\nI am so exhausted...\\fThis job uses so much of your energy...","msg_0133_D47_00017":"Safari Zone\\rThis is where everything is thrilling.\\nFeel free to come by and experience\\fthe wild!"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_D47_014 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_D47_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_D47_011":11,"_EV_s